.TH SY 1 "October 2026" "sy 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sy \- Fedora desktop environment and agent tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sy
\fICOMMAND\fR [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sy
manages the desktop, AI plane, agent runner, and knowledge services.
Run \fBsy --help\fR or \fBsy COMMAND --help\fR for complete options and examples.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B apply
Render desktop configuration and sync user systemd units. Use \fB--dry-run\fR to preview.
.TP
.B power
Open the session power menu or run a named action. Use \fB--dry-run\fR to preview.
.TP
.B aiplane
Inspect or run registered inference workloads through the AI daemon.
.TP
.B doctor
Check desktop and service health; \fB--json\fR emits a machine-readable report.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/sy
Packaged configuration, themes, and system integration scripts.
.SH SEE ALSO
.B sy --help
